Provenance

This repository is a fork of https://github.com/mattpocock/skills. Content
that originated upstream — and any modification of it — remains the copyright
of Matt Pocock, and the MIT terms above continue to bind it. Content that
originated in this fork and has no counterpart upstream is the copyright of
Galo Sandoval, licensed to you under those same MIT terms.

If you are copying a file out of this repository and need to know whose notice
to reproduce, ask git rather than guessing:

    git log --diff-filter=A --format='%an %ad' -- <path>

An "added" commit authored in this fork means the file is Galo Sandoval's; one
reachable from the upstream history means it is Matt Pocock's. Either way the
grant is the same MIT licence, so reproducing this file in full satisfies the
notice requirement for any file in the repository.
